<title>USA: Coleman CEO Jerry Levin to remain in post.</title>
<headline>Coleman CEO Jerry Levin to remain in post.</headline>
<dateline>GOLDEN, Colo 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coleman Co Inc Chief Executive Jerry Levin said Tuesday that the company has ended its efforts to recruit another chief executive from outside the company.</p>
<p>&quot;At the request of the board of directors, I will remain a chairman and chief executive officer until the company's current business plan has been fully executed,&quot; Levin said in a company statement.</p>
<p>Coleman named Levin as acting chief executive in February to succeed Michael Hammes.</p>
